      "title": "Fish stocks (RAM Legacy Stock Assessment Database)",
      "description": "The RAM Legacy Stock Assessment Database is a compilation of stock assessment results for commercially exploited marine populations from around the world. It provides data on fish biomass, catch, fishing intensity and other indicators of stock status, used to evaluate the abundance and exploitation of fish populations.",
